      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Renaerawan",
            text: _("We are gathered here today in remembrance of our dear colleague and friend, Dacyn, who fell even as he vanquished the arch-lich Mal-Ravanal."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Renaerawan",
            text: _("I knew Dacyn as a complicated man: ambitious yet loyal, proud yet wise. But above all, Dacyn sought to act for the good of Wesnoth, and today we honor him for that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("Today we have won a great victory, yet it comes at great cost."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grug",
            text: _("Grug sad! Magic man kind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolburras",
            text: _("Ay. Too many ha’ died in this war, both my kinsmen at Knalga and yours here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("So many months of fighting... I feel as though I am awakening from a long nightmare."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("My duty is done; the Clans have been avenged. At last, I can rest in peace."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("Alas, our work is not yet complete. Mal-Ravanal’s host has been broken, but in its wake, chaos and disorder prevail throughout the countryside. We will be years... decades... recovering from the ill wrought here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aeraeka",
            text: _("Even now we should be sending what’s left of our armies to restore order throughout the land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("Wesnoth is bowed, but thanks to the efforts of many heroes we stand yet unbroken. And now, at long last, the time has come to rebuild."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad_II.webp",
            text: _("To each of you, take as Our first command to you your own wish! Go from here; secure our borders. Show all that the might of Wesnoth will endure!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_6",
          },
        ],
